* {{audio|en|En-us-smoking.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|əʊkɪŋ|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|smokynge}}, {{m|enm|smokiende}}, from {{inh|en|ang|smociende|t=smoking}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*smukōndz|t=emitting smoke, smoking}}, equivalent to {{af|en|smoke|-ing}}.

====Verb====
{{head|en|verb form}}

# {{inflection of|en|smoke||pres|part}}

====Adjective====
{{en-adj}}

# Giving off [[smoke]].
# {{lb|en|slang}} [[sexually|Sexually]] [[attractive]], usually referring to a [[woman]].
#: {{ux|en|That woman is '''smoking'''!}}
# {{lb|en|slang}} Showing great [[skill]] or [[talent]].
#: {{ux|en|The band put on a '''smoking''' performance.}}

